// 003.14, 010.12, 010.14 (D37, #42, #58, #22): `$` money literals, `: USD` currency shorthand,
// declaration-site `Var ... = init`, `%` and `bps` rate literals, and same-unit `MulDivRound` ratios.
Role borrower Is Elena
Role lender Is Marcus
Param loan = $10,000.00
Param annual-rate : Rate = 6%
Param fee-bps : Rate = 150 bps
Var principal : USD = loan
Var paid : USD = $0

Act pay Actor borrower Recipient lender Related to amount : USD
  Holds when amount <= principal
  Creates principal(principal - amount), paid(paid + amount)
.
?(principal == $10,000.00).
?(paid == $0.00).
?(MulDivRound(principal, annual-rate, NearestEven) == $600.00).
?(MulDivRound(principal, fee-bps, Floor) == $150.00).
pay($2,500.00).
?(principal == $7,500.00).
?(paid == $2,500.00).
// Same-unit Money ratio (#22):
?(MulDivRound($1,000.00, paid, loan, Floor) == $250.00).
